withdrawn about $150 million in UST from Curve\\'s 3pool, and less than 10 minutes later the pool saw an $85 million swap that the filing says precipitated a steep UST sell-off.',\n    'The filing reportedly claims Jane Street later shorted UST and LUNA after learning details of a confidential rescue effort and ultimately made more than $134 million across the trades.',\n    'The Terra ecosystem\\'s collapse erased roughly $40 billion in value and helped trigger wider crypto contagion that later hit firms including Celsius, Three Arrows Capital, Voyager and FTX.',\n    'Jane Street denied wrongdoing, with a spokesperson telling Decrypt the suit is a baseless attempt to shift blame from Terraform management for the multibillion-dollar fraud behind Terra\\'s collapse.'\n  ],\n  'aggregated_raw_content': agg\n}\nout=Path('/tmp/crypto-run-20260521-131248/research/raw.json')\nout.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\nout.write_text(json.dumps(obj, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))\nprint('WROTE', out)\nprint('WORDS', len(re.findall(r\"\\\\b\\w+\\\\b\", agg)))\nPY","workdir":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-researcher","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":348,"output":1319,"cacheRead":44800,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46467,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779369323492,"responseId":"chatcmpl-DhxX9iwXJpUA9PxmHlIElP5VBt0ho"}}
